{%- comment -%}
  Naira Flore - Welcome Offer popup (src/components/WelcomeOfferPopup.tsx)

  A computed-style diff of the React homepage against this theme found the
  whole component missing: React renders a first-visit lead-capture modal,
  the theme rendered nothing. This section is the port.

  BEHAVIOUR PORTED FROM THE REACT SOURCE
  - First appearance: 9000ms after page load, but only once. Gate is
    localStorage["naira-promo-popup-seen"] === "1" (src/lib/promo.ts,
    hasSeenPromoPopup/markPromoPopupSeen). Same key, same value, same
    mechanism here, so a visitor who dismissed it on the React site is not
    shown it again on this one.
  - Dismissal: the backdrop, the top-right X, and the "No thanks" link all
    mark it seen and hide it. Escape does the same (React did not bind
    Escape at all; this port adds it, since every other close path already
    means "seen").
  - Tabs: Email / WhatsApp swap the single input's type, placeholder,
    autocomplete and screen-reader label, and clear any value/error.
  - Submit: validated client-side with the exact regexes from
    WelcomeOfferPopup.tsx (isValid). On success both channels mark it seen,
    normalise+store the discount code to localStorage["naira-promo-code"]
    and the lead to localStorage["naira-promo-lead"] (same keys and JSON
    shape as savePromoLead/setPromoCode in src/lib/promo.ts), then reveal
    the "claimed" panel in place, exactly as React's setClaimed(true) does.
  - Guard: never opens on top of the cart. React reads its own React cart
    context (isDrawerOpen / totalItems); this theme has no such context, so
    the same intent is read off the DOM the header already maintains:
    [data-nf-cart-count] (real cart.item_count, sections/nf-header.liquid)
    and any open .nf-drawer (assets/nf-cart.js, PDP only). This checks once
    at the moment the popup would open, not continuously like React's
    render gate re-checks; see the "not reproduced" note at the bottom.

  SUBMIT PATH - DECISION
  React's own "submit" never leaves the browser: savePromoLead() only
  writes to localStorage, and trackPixel("Lead", ...) is a Meta Pixel
  event, not a transport for the address itself. Nothing in the source
  posts the email or phone anywhere reachable, so porting that literally
  would silently drop every lead, on both sites.
  - Email: goes to Shopify's own native customer form, {% form 'customer' %}
    with contact[email] + a contact[tags] marker. That is a real endpoint
    that actually delivers the address into Shopify Customers, same
    pattern as this theme's own newsletter-style signups.
  - WhatsApp: Shopify has no native phone-capture endpoint. Cramming a
    phone number into contact[email] would not deliver anything either.
    Instead this reuses the theme's own established wa.me pattern (see
    nf-footer.liquid, nf-header.liquid, nf-product.liquid, all default to
    919561557935): the WhatsApp tab hands off to a wa.me link, prefilled
    with the visitor's number, opened in a new tab for the visitor to send.
    That is a guaranteed-reachable, one-tap delivery to the merchant's own
    WhatsApp - the honest option for a channel Shopify cannot capture
    natively. Section setting "whatsapp_number" is that merchant number.
    If it is blank the WhatsApp tab is not rendered at all, rather than
    faking a success state for a channel that would deliver nothing.

  Submitting the native form is a real page POST + reload. On the reload
  Liquid's `form` object (posted_successfully? / errors / email) is only
  in scope inside {% form %}...{% endform %}, so instead of trying to gate
  the whole popup's initial markup on it (impossible - `form` does not
  exist yet when the outer wrapper's opening tag is written), this drops
  two small hidden markers *inside* the form when relevant
  (data-nf-wop-posted / data-nf-wop-server-error) and boot script reads
  them to decide whether to open already-claimed or already-showing an
  error, exactly mirroring what a full React re-render would have shown.

  WHERE THIS GOES
  This is global chrome (a viewport overlay), not page-flow content, so it
  does not belong in templates/index.json - see nf-chrome.js for the
  existing convention of shipping overlays sitewide rather than per
  template. Unlike nf-chrome.js's decorative layers this needs a real
  Liquid section (merchant settings, a schema, an enable toggle), so it
  belongs in a section group instead. Recommended: sections/footer-group.json
  (see this section's accompanying report for the exact JSON to add - this
  file does not touch group/template JSON itself).

  NOT REPRODUCED
  - React's render gate (isDrawerOpen / totalItems > 0) re-evaluates on
    every React re-render, so the popup can silently reappear later if the
    cart empties back out while it is still logically "open". This port
    only checks once, at the instant the 9s timer fires - a deliberate
    simplification, not an oversight; see the guard note above.
  - The `animate-fade-in` class on the source panel resolves to nothing:
    it matches no Tailwind core utility, no plugin utility (tailwindcss-
    animate ships `fade-in`/`animate-in`, not the compound class actually
    used) and nothing in tailwind.config.ts or index.css defines it either.
    grep confirms zero occurrences in the built CSS
    (dist/assets/index-BoPMSdgV.css). The live popup has no entrance
    animation. This port matches that: no fade/scale on open.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign wop_settings = section.settings
  assign wop_show_whatsapp = false
  unless wop_settings.whatsapp_number == blank
    assign wop_show_whatsapp = true
  endunless
  assign wop_whatsapp_group_label = 'Choose how to receive your code'
-%}

{%- if wop_settings.enable -%}
<div class="nf-wop" id="NfWelcomeOffer-{{ section.id }}" data-nf-welcome-offer aria-hidden="true"
  data-discount-code="{{ wop_settings.discount_code | strip | escape }}"
  data-whatsapp-number="{{ wop_settings.whatsapp_number | strip | escape }}"
  data-email-placeholder="{{ wop_settings.email_placeholder | escape }}"
  data-whatsapp-placeholder="{{ wop_settings.whatsapp_placeholder | escape }}"
  data-email-sr-label="{{ wop_settings.email_sr_label | escape }}"
  data-whatsapp-sr-label="{{ wop_settings.whatsapp_sr_label | escape }}"
  data-email-error="{{ wop_settings.email_error | escape }}"
  data-whatsapp-error="{{ wop_settings.whatsapp_error | escape }}"
  data-copied-label="{{ wop_settings.claimed_copied_label | escape }}"
>
  <button type="button" class="nf-wop__backdrop" data-nf-wop-dismiss aria-label="Close offer"></button>

  <div class="nf-wop__panel" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="Welcome offer" tabindex="-1" data-nf-wop-panel>
    <button type="button" class="nf-wop__close" data-nf-wop-dismiss aria-label="Close">
      <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M18 6 6 18"/><path d="m6 6 12 12"/></svg>
    </button>

    <div class="nf-wop__claimed" data-nf-wop-claimed hidden>
      <div class="nf-wop__claimed-icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h2 class="nf-wop__claimed-heading" tabindex="-1" data-nf-wop-claimed-heading>{{ wop_settings.claimed_heading | escape }}</h2>
      <p class="nf-wop__claimed-body">{{ wop_settings.claimed_body | escape }}</p>
      <button type="button" class="nf-wop__code" data-nf-wop-code>{{ wop_settings.discount_code | escape }}</button>
      <button type="button" class="nf-wop__shopping" data-nf-wop-dismiss>{{ wop_settings.claimed_cta | escape }}</button>
    </div>

    <div class="nf-wop__entry" data-nf-wop-entry>
      <p class="nf-wop__eyebrow">{{ wop_settings.eyebrow | escape }}</p>
      <h2 class="nf-wop__heading">{{ wop_settings.heading | escape }}</h2>
      <p class="nf-wop__sub">{{ wop_settings.subheading | escape }}</p>

      {%- if wop_show_whatsapp -%}
        <div class="nf-wop__tabs" role="group" aria-label="{{ wop_whatsapp_group_label }}">
          <button type="button" class="nf-wop__tab is-active" data-nf-wop-tab="email" aria-pressed="true">
            <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"/><path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"/></svg>
            {{- wop_settings.tab_email_label | escape -}}
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="nf-wop__tab" data-nf-wop-tab="whatsapp" aria-pressed="false">
            <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M7.9 20A9 9 0 1 0 4 16.1L2 22Z"/></svg>
            {{- wop_settings.tab_whatsapp_label | escape -}}
          </button>
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- form 'customer', id: 'NfWelcomeOfferForm-' | append: section.id, class: 'nf-wop__form' -%}
        <input type="hidden" name="contact[tags]" value="welcome-offer">
        {%- if form.posted_successfully? -%}
          <input type="hidden" data-nf-wop-posted value="1">
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if form.errors -%}
          <input type="hidden" data-nf-wop-server-error value="{{ form.errors.messages | first | escape }}">
        {%- endif -%}

        <label class="visually-hidden" for="NfWelcomeOfferInput-{{ section.id }}" data-nf-wop-label>{{ wop_settings.email_sr_label | escape }}</label>
        <input
          type="email"
          inputmode="email"
          autocomplete="email"
          name="contact[email]"
          id="NfWelcomeOfferInput-{{ section.id }}"
          class="nf-wop__input"
          maxlength="120"
          placeholder="{{ wop_settings.email_placeholder | escape }}"
          value="{{ form.email }}"
          aria-describedby="NfWelcomeOfferError-{{ section.id }}"
          data-nf-wop-input
        >
        <p class="nf-wop__error" id="NfWelcomeOfferError-{{ section.id }}" role="alert" data-nf-wop-error hidden></p>

        <button type="submit" class="press-scale nf-wop__submit" data-nf-wop-submit>{{ wop_settings.submit_label | escape }}</button>
      {%- endform -%}

      <button type="button" class="nf-wop__dismiss" data-nf-wop-dismiss>{{ wop_settings.dismiss_label | escape }}</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
(function () {
  'use strict';
  var root = document.querySelector('[data-nf-welcome-offer]');
  if (!root || root.dataset.wopReady) return;
  root.dataset.wopReady = '1';

  var SEEN_KEY = 'naira-promo-popup-seen';
  var CODE_KEY = 'naira-promo-code';
  var LEAD_KEY = 'naira-promo-lead';
  var OPEN_DELAY = 9000;

  function writeLS(key, value) {
    try { window.localStorage.setItem(key, value); } catch (e) { /* storage full / private mode */ }
  }
  function hasSeenPopup() {
    try { return window.localStorage.getItem(SEEN_KEY) === '1'; } catch (e) { return true; }
  }
  function markSeen() { writeLS(SEEN_KEY, '1'); }
  function normalizeCode(code) {
    return String(code || '').normalize('NFKC').toUpperCase().replace(/[^A-Z0-9]/g, '');
  }
  function trim(s) { return String(s || '').replace(/^\s+|\s+$/g, ''); }

  var panel = root.querySelector('[data-nf-wop-panel]');
  var entry = root.querySelector('[data-nf-wop-entry]');
  var claimed = root.querySelector('[data-nf-wop-claimed]');
  var claimedHeading = root.querySelector('[data-nf-wop-claimed-heading]');
  var codeBtn = root.querySelector('[data-nf-wop-code]');
  var tabs = root.querySelectorAll('[data-nf-wop-tab]');
  var form = root.querySelector('[data-nf-wop-entry] form');
  var input = root.querySelector('[data-nf-wop-input]');
  var label = root.querySelector('[data-nf-wop-label]');
  var errorEl = root.querySelector('[data-nf-wop-error]');
  var closeBtn = root.querySelector('.nf-wop__close');
  var dismissEls = root.querySelectorAll('[data-nf-wop-dismiss]');
  if (!panel || !entry || !claimed || !form || !input) return;

  form.noValidate = true;

  var discountCode = root.getAttribute('data-discount-code') || '';
  var whatsappNumber = (root.getAttribute('data-whatsapp-number') || '').replace(/[^0-9]/g, '');
  var emailPlaceholder = root.getAttribute('data-email-placeholder') || '';
  var whatsappPlaceholder = root.getAttribute('data-whatsapp-placeholder') || '';
  var emailSrLabel = root.getAttribute('data-email-sr-label') || '';
  var whatsappSrLabel = root.getAttribute('data-whatsapp-sr-label') || '';
  var emailError = root.getAttribute('data-email-error') || '';
  var whatsappError = root.getAttribute('data-whatsapp-error') || '';
  var copiedLabel = root.getAttribute('data-copied-label') || '';

  var channel = 'email';
  var isOpen = false;
  var lastFocused = null;
  var copyTimer = null;

  function isValid(ch, value) {
    var v = trim(value);
    if (ch === 'email') return /^[^\s@]+@[^\s@]+\.[^\s@]{2,}$/.test(v);
    return /^\+?[0-9\s-]{10,15}$/.test(v);
  }

  function setChannel(next, preserveValue) {
    channel = next;
    if (!preserveValue) input.value = '';
    hideError();
    if (channel === 'email') {
      input.type = 'email';
      input.setAttribute('inputmode', 'email');
      input.setAttribute('autocomplete', 'email');
      input.setAttribute('name', 'contact[email]');
      input.placeholder = emailPlaceholder;
      if (label) label.textContent = emailSrLabel;
    } else {
      input.type = 'tel';
      input.setAttribute('inputmode', 'tel');
      input.setAttribute('autocomplete', 'tel');
      input.removeAttribute('name'); // never posts to Shopify as an email address
      input.placeholder = whatsappPlaceholder;
      if (label) label.textContent = whatsappSrLabel;
    }
    for (var i = 0; i < tabs.length; i++) {
      var on = tabs[i].getAttribute('data-nf-wop-tab') === channel;
      tabs[i].classList.toggle('is-active', on);
      tabs[i].setAttribute('aria-pressed', on ? 'true' : 'false');
    }
  }

  function showError(text) {
    if (!errorEl || !text) return;
    errorEl.textContent = text;
    errorEl.hidden = false;
    input.setAttribute('aria-invalid', 'true');
  }
  function hideError() {
    if (!errorEl) return;
    errorEl.hidden = true;
    errorEl.textContent = '';
    input.removeAttribute('aria-invalid');
  }

  function lockScroll(on) { document.body.style.overflow = on ? 'hidden' : ''; }

  function open() {
    if (isOpen) return;
    isOpen = true;
    lastFocused = document.activeElement;
    root.classList.add('is-open');
    root.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'false');
    lockScroll(true);
    document.addEventListener('keydown', onKeydown);
    if (window.trapFocus) window.trapFocus(panel, closeBtn || panel);
    else if (closeBtn) closeBtn.focus();
  }

  function close() {
    if (!isOpen) return;
    isOpen = false;
    root.classList.remove('is-open');
    root.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'true');
    lockScroll(false);
    document.removeEventListener('keydown', onKeydown);
    if (window.removeTrapFocus) window.removeTrapFocus(lastFocused);
    else if (lastFocused && lastFocused.focus) lastFocused.focus();
    lastFocused = null;
  }

  function dismiss() { markSeen(); close(); }

  function onKeydown(e) {
    if (e.key === 'Escape' || e.key === 'Esc') { e.preventDefault(); dismiss(); }
  }

  function claim(ch, value) {
    markSeen();
    writeLS(CODE_KEY, normalizeCode(discountCode));
    try {
      writeLS(LEAD_KEY, JSON.stringify({ channel: ch, value: value, at: new Date().toISOString() }));
    } catch (e) { /* noop */ }
    entry.hidden = true;
    claimed.hidden = false;
    if (claimedHeading && claimedHeading.focus) claimedHeading.focus();
  }

  function whatsappHandoff(value) {
    if (!whatsappNumber) return;
    var text = 'Hi Naira Flore! Please send my ' + discountCode + ' welcome code to ' + value + '.';
    window.open('https://wa.me/' + whatsappNumber + '?text=' + encodeURIComponent(text), '_blank', 'noopener,noreferrer');
  }

  // Never sit on top of the cart or interrupt a shopper mid-checkout. React
  // reads its own cart context (isDrawerOpen / totalItems); this theme has
  // no such context, so the same intent is read off the DOM the header and
  // cart drawer already maintain.
  function cartBlocksPopup() {
    var badge = document.querySelector('[data-nf-cart-count]');
    if (badge && !badge.hidden) return true;
    if (document.querySelector('.nf-drawer.is-open, [data-nf-drawer].is-open')) return true;
    return false;
  }

  // -- tabs --------------------------------------------------------------
  for (var t = 0; t < tabs.length; t++) {
    tabs[t].addEventListener('click', function (e) {
      setChannel(e.currentTarget.getAttribute('data-nf-wop-tab'));
      input.focus();
    });
  }

  // -- dismiss (backdrop, X, "No thanks", "Start Shopping") --------------
  for (var d = 0; d < dismissEls.length; d++) dismissEls[d].addEventListener('click', dismiss);

  // -- submit --------------------------------------------------------------
  form.addEventListener('submit', function (e) {
    var value = input.value;
    if (!isValid(channel, value)) {
      e.preventDefault();
      showError(channel === 'email' ? emailError : whatsappError);
      return;
    }
    hideError();
    if (channel === 'whatsapp') {
      // No native Shopify endpoint for a phone number: hand off to the
      // merchant's own WhatsApp instead of posting the form.
      e.preventDefault();
      whatsappHandoff(trim(value));
      claim('whatsapp', trim(value));
      return;
    }
    // channel === 'email': let the native customer form POST through.
    // Shopify owns delivery from here and reloads the page with
    // form.posted_successfully? true - handled by the boot block below.
  });

  // -- copy code -----------------------------------------------------------
  if (codeBtn) {
    codeBtn.addEventListener('click', function () {
      if (!navigator.clipboard) return;
      navigator.clipboard.writeText(discountCode).then(function () {
        codeBtn.textContent = copiedLabel;
        window.clearTimeout(copyTimer);
        copyTimer = window.setTimeout(function () { codeBtn.textContent = discountCode; }, 1800);
      }).catch(function () { /* clipboard unavailable */ });
    });
  }

  // -- boot ------------------------------------------------------------
  var initialValue = input.value;
  setChannel('email', true);
  if (initialValue) input.value = initialValue;

  var postedMarker = root.querySelector('[data-nf-wop-posted]');
  var serverErrorMarker = root.querySelector('[data-nf-wop-server-error]');

  if (postedMarker) {
    // A real customer-form POST just came back successful.
    open();
    claim('email', initialValue);
  } else if (serverErrorMarker) {
    // Shopify's own validation rejected the POST; show it like a client error.
    open();
    showError(serverErrorMarker.value || emailError);
  } else if (!hasSeenPopup()) {
    window.setTimeout(function () {
      if (cartBlocksPopup()) return;
      open();
    }, OPEN_DELAY);
  }
})();
</script>
{%- endif -%}

{% stylesheet %}
/* nf-wop = Naira Flore Welcome Offer Popup. All colours here are literal
   values copied from WelcomeOfferPopup.tsx, not --nf-* tokens: none of the
   tokens in nf-tokens.css matches them exactly, and hsl(186 35% 28%) in
   particular is the same bare-literal teal this theme already uses in
   nf-card.css, nf-home.css, nf-cart.liquid and nf-new-arrivals.liquid.
   Type outside .nf-wop__heading/.nf-wop__sub/.nf-wop__dismiss/.nf-wop__claimed-*
   is left to inherit the sitewide ui-sans-serif stack nf-base.css already
   sets on <body> (== Tailwind preflight's default, the same stack the
   source's un-classed text resolves to); only the elements React marks
   font-cormorant get var(--nf-font-display) here. */

.nf-wop {
  display: none;
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  z-index: 120;
  align-items: flex-end;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 0 1rem 1rem;
}
.nf-wop.is-open { display: flex; }
@media (min-width: 640px) {
  .nf-wop { align-items: center; padding: 0 1rem; }
}

.nf-wop__backdrop {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  border: 0;
  background-color: hsl(0 0% 8% / 0.5);
  cursor: pointer;
}

.nf-wop__panel {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 420px;
  padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem;
  background-color: hsl(33 41% 97%);
  border: 1px solid hsl(150 12% 78%);
}
@media (min-width: 640px) {
  .nf-wop__panel { padding: 2.25rem 2rem; }
}

.nf-wop__close {
  position: absolute;
  top: 0.75rem;
  right: 0.75rem;
  width: 40px;
  height: 40px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  background: transparent;
  border: 0;
  color: hsl(0 0% 45%);
  cursor: pointer;
}

.nf-wop__eyebrow {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: 10px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.32em;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: hsl(186 35% 28%);
}

.nf-wop__heading {
  margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
  font-family: var(--nf-font-display);
  font-size: 30px;
  line-height: 1.1;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: hsl(0 0% 12%);
}

.nf-wop__sub {
  margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
  font-family: var(--nf-font-display);
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: hsl(0 0% 45%);
}

.nf-wop__tabs {
  display: flex;
  margin-top: 1.25rem;
  border: 1px solid hsl(0 0% 84%);
}
.nf-wop__tab {
  flex: 1 1 0%;
  height: 42px;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  background: transparent;
  border: 0;
  font-size: 11px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  color: hsl(0 0% 40%);
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: background-color 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
}
.nf-wop__tab.is-active {
  background-color: hsl(186 35% 28%);
  color: hsl(0 0% 100%);
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .nf-wop__tab { transition: none; }
}

.nf-wop__form { margin-top: 0.75rem; }

.nf-wop__input {
  width: 100%;
  height: 48px;
  padding: 0 1rem;
  font-size: 14px;
  border: 1px solid hsl(0 0% 82%);
  background-color: hsl(0 0% 100%);
  color: hsl(0 0% 18%);
}
/* Suppress the mouse-click focus ring only; :focus-visible (keyboard) keeps
   the sitewide gold ring from nf-base.css untouched, so the hard
   accessibility requirement for a visible focus-visible state still holds. */
.nf-wop__input:focus:not(:focus-visible) { outline: none; }

.nf-wop__error {
  margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
  font-size: 12px;
  color: hsl(0 65% 45%);
}

.nf-wop__submit {
  width: 100%;
  height: 50px;
  margin-top: 0.75rem;
  border: 0;
  background-color: hsl(0 0% 12%);
  color: hsl(0 0% 100%);
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 500;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.nf-wop__dismiss {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  margin-top: 0.75rem;
  min-height: 40px;
  background: transparent;
  border: 0;
  font-family: var(--nf-font-display);
  font-size: 13px;
  text-decoration: underline;
  text-underline-offset: 4px;
  color: hsl(0 0% 50%);
  cursor: pointer;
}

.nf-wop__claimed { text-align: center; }
.nf-wop__claimed-icon {
  margin: 0 auto;
  width: 48px;
  height: 48px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  background-color: hsl(150 18% 88%);
  color: hsl(186 35% 28%);
}
.nf-wop__claimed-heading {
  margin: 1.25rem 0 0;
  font-family: var(--nf-font-display);
  font-size: 26px;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: hsl(0 0% 14%);
}
.nf-wop__claimed-body {
  margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
  font-family: var(--nf-font-display);
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: hsl(0 0% 45%);
}
.nf-wop__code {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: 52px;
  margin-top: 1.25rem;
  background-color: hsl(0 0% 100%);
  border: 1px dashed hsl(186 35% 40%);
  color: hsl(186 35% 28%);
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 600;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.24em;
  cursor: pointer;
}
.nf-wop__shopping {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: 48px;
  margin-top: 1rem;
  border: 0;
  background-color: hsl(186 35% 28%);
  color: hsl(0 0% 100%);
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 500;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  cursor: pointer;
}
{% endstylesheet %}

